file caravan/abandon.rye forty-three rungs each keep a seven-line stub delegating to the harness -- abandon is the first of them alphabetically
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish ceiling, body counts, and the top-four queue rows re-read from the scan; the fold-queue and GREEN prose speak this lap
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh CARAVAN_CARRY_CEILING lowered 62964 -> 62334, the ratchet that only comes down
file tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish head slot slid to read_the_reply by fall, asked_of added as the second-by-fall row and the private-function example, choose_pass moved to the folded-this-lap slot, sink totals re-read
recommend keep-going read_the_reply leads by fall at 414 and widens nothing of any kind -- ten rungs at forty-nine lines, the largest free return left on the ladder -- while mend_the_plan leads by carry and would return only 72, so the next lap should take the fall head and let the carry head wait for a shorter signature
